    "image_path": "images/slide_05.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "可是，贝琳达有个大问题，嗯，\n应该说有两个大问题：\n\n就是她的左脚和右脚。",
    "page_text_en": "But, Bellinda had a big problem, well,\nshould say two big problems:\n\nHer left foot and her right foot.",
