    "page_text_en": "\"Oh my!\" said Lord Brindle III, \"Your feet are as big as a boat!\"\nFamous New York critic George Root said, \"They're just like a seal's flippers!\"\nMs. Ona Lawup, who often writes for dance magazines, stared with her eyes wide and shook her head.\nBefore Belinda even tried to dance, the judges said, \"Go back. Those feet of yours will never be good for dancing!\"",
    "summary_zh": "贝琳达在芭蕾舞选拔中还未开始表演，评审们就因她巨大的脚而嘲笑并拒绝她，认为她永远跳不好芭蕾舞。"
  },
