    "page_text_en": "So, Belinda stopped dancing.\n\nShe told herself, \"I'll give up ballet.\" \n\nFreddy's Restaurant\nHelp Wanted\nIndoor Band!\nComing Soon!\n\nSince she no longer danced, she had to find something else to do. But, besides dancing, she couldn't do anything. She searched and searched, and finally found a job at Freddy's Restaurant.",
